  "title": "gsup: PDP Address IE: Update naming and improve dissecting",
  "description": "This IE has been recently renamed in GSUP protocol spec [1] and main\nimplementation (libosmocore) [2] from \"PDP Type\" to \"PDP Address\",\nupdate it here too.\nWhile at it, properly dissect the type_org, type_nr and address buffers.\n\n[1] https://gitea.osmocom.org/cellular-infrastructure/osmo-gsm-manuals/commit/602fabc6d557deb45af41d1149a68e4a78be9a84\n[2] https://gitea.osmocom.org/osmocom/libosmocore/commit/74ee02420a6c53ad9412fc6315183c123cda4d13",
